            "review_text": "David Kelly T\nBoston, Massachusetts86 contributions\n0\n‘Sea’ the Fish, Eat the Fish, As Fresh as it Can Go!\nMar 2023 • Couples\nWe loved Ba Năm Hai San so much, we went two nights in a row! Everything from service to the ambience of the restaurant was so unique. The manager of the restaurant provided different types of suggestions for whichever seafood we were craved. For the two nights we went, we tried the Mi Hai San (Stir fried noodles and seafood), Snails cooked in coconut, steamed crab, shrimps, oysters, and steamed fish with a side of Vietnamese tomato soup and vermicelli noodles. What made the experience so magical was seeing the fish and mollusks still alive. They weigh them for you and tell you how much it would cost. Great experience and I cannot recommend anywhere else. There’s a reason it was crowded by both locals and tourists each night we went.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 25, 2023",
