            "review_text": "Thibault V\nAarhus, Denmark18 contributions\n0\nAuthentic Vietnamese sea food experience\nApr 2023 • Friends\nAuthentic Vietnamese sea food experience! They have fish, crabs, prawns, oysters, snails all alive in tanks. You get to pick what you want and they cook it however way on the spot, as fresh as you can ever go! The staff is super nice and can help with for example cracking open the crabs. The manager is friendly and always wants to practice her English. Highly recommend.\nRead more\nWritten April 22, 2023",
